        "name": "Batman: Arkham Collection",
        "summary": "Batman: Arkham Collection includes the definitive versions of Rocksteady's Arkham Trilogy games, including all post-launch content, in one complete collection.\n\nBatman: Arkham Asylum and Batman: Arkham City have been remastered with updated visuals. The collection is completed by Batman: Arkham Knight.",
